We are tasked with ascertaining the cardinality of the set of ternary tuples $(a, b, c)$ satisfying the requisite constraints.

The requisite conditions may be formally expressed as follows:

1.  $a \in \mathbb{Z}^+ \cap [1, \infty) \cap \{ \mathfrak{R} \mid \mathfrak{R} \in \mathbb{N} \} \cap \{1, 2, \ldots, 9\}$;
